    "description": "In this video, Chef John shows you how to make a firm, yet tender, Denver omelet. This brunch recipe starts by softening diced onion, bell pepper, and smokey ham over the stove. Once the vegetables have softened, add in a whisked egg and mix it together until the ingredients have distributed evenly. Sprinkle grated cheese over the top before allowing the omelet to firm before folding. It’s loaded with sweet and savory flavor and is great for breakfast, lunch, or dinner!",
